Welcome to the Department of English at Arizona State University!  We are excited to have you join us.  If you have not already done so, please schedule a phone appointment with one of our academic advisors through our online EZ appointment scheduler at: https://english.clas.asu.edu/advising. All appointments are made in Arizona time. 

Please note that if you are a transfer student, our evaluation team may need 1 to 2 weeks to evaluate your transcripts. You will be contacted once this is complete. You are more than welcome to begin advising and course registration while your transcripts are being evaluated and we will help you as much as possible with this. 

We look forward to working with you.
 
Regards,

Your English Department Advising Team

Shauna Dranetz, shauna.dranetz@asu.edu
